{
  "name": "单桅纵帆船",
  "category": "tfc:firmaciv",
  "icon": "firmaciv:sloop_icon_only",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "已经进入钢铁时代了？那么，是时候造一艘像样的船了。单桅纵帆船宽 4 格、长超过 8 格，是对划艇一次令人印象深刻的升级！它可容纳多达 13 个容器和最多 7 名乘客，并且根据风力可以航行得非常快。它还可以携带多达 6 门加农炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "images": [
        "firmaciv:textures/gui/book/sloop_isometric.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "不过，单桅纵帆船也很昂贵，需要大量的钢、铜、羊毛及其他材料。但代价不止是材料！你还得学会如何航行，而这需要一些练习！如果你计划让你的船靠近岸边，你很可能还需要修建码头和其他基础设施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "以下是建造单桅纵帆船的材料清单：$(br2)钢锭×12$(br)铜锭×24$(br)木板×648$(br)原木×34$(br)羊毛布×24$(br)细绳×6$(br)黄麻纤维×72"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "title": "脚手架",
      "recipe": "firmaciv:crafting/watercraft_frame_flat",
      "text": "与划艇类似，你将从造船脚手架开始。不过，较大的船还需要一种新的平板变体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
      "multiblock": {
        "pattern": [
          [
            "     ",
            "     ",
            "     ",
            "     ",
            "     ",
            "     ",
            "     "
          ],
          [
            "  12 ",
            "  34 ",
            " 1562",
            " 30a4",
            " 3aa4",
            " 3aa4",
            " 7889"
          ]
        ],
        "mapping": {
          "1": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=west,shape=inner_right]",
          "2": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=west,shape=inner_left]",
          "3": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=north,shape=straight]",
          "4": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=south,shape=straight]",
          "5": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=west,shape=outer_right]",
          "6": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=west,shape=outer_left]",
          "7": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=east,shape=inner_left]",
          "8": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=east,shape=straight]",
          "9": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_angled[facing=east,shape=inner_right]",
          "0": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_flat",
          "a": "firmaciv:watercraft_frame_flat"
        }
      },
      "name": "单桅纵帆船脚手架",
      "text": "为建造单桅纵帆船船体而摆放好的造船脚手架。",
      "enable_visualize": true
    },

    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "接下来，你需要添加足够坚硬的硬木木板：$(br2)金合欢$(br)白蜡$(br)白杨$(br)桦木$(br)黑木$(br)栗木$(br)山胡桃$(br)枫木$(br)橡木$(br)玫瑰木$(br)悬铃木"
    },
